21
00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.390
And we actually, I mean, there was a a court decision

22
00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:15.654
that was made that because she had worn a bathing suit

23
00:01:15.654 --> 00:01:18.440
and posed for Playboy, which is not the same thing

24
00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.030
