45
00:02:10.687 --> 00:02:13.670
I'm not in the seat of my own experience,

46
00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.205
then it's not okay.

47
00:02:15.205 --> 00:02:19.970
And so it really has nothing to do with the content.

48
00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:22.960
It has to do with the idea that this was stolen from her

49
00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.200
and this wasn't her choice.

50
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.361
And in that way, I think that Pam is a hero.

51
00:02:27.361 --> 00:02:29.488
I mean, she's truly a hero.

52
00:02:29.488 --> 00:02:32.488
