59
00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.100
105 million views.

60
00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.833
It's a global phenomenon.

61
00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:54.940
What was that moment like for you

62
00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.849
