63
00:02:57.849 --> 00:02:59.905
how we live our lives?

64
00:02:59.905 --> 00:03:01.610
I had no idea.

65
00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.532
I still don't.

66
00:03:02.532 --> 00:03:05.130
It just was your producer that told me

67
00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:07.550
it was 105 million views.

68
00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.920
I mean, I know when I go to, you know, airports,

69
00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:14.866 line:15%
everyone's like, anywhere I go, Piper, you know,

70
00:03:14.866 --> 00:03:15.960 line:15%
Piper exists.

71
00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.890 line:15%
But I thought we were making...

72
00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:20.900
I mean, we thought that that, and I am not being coy

73
00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.010
or being hyperbolic with my like innocence,

74
00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.740
but it felt like that was a...

75
00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.560
We were making some kind of a web series

76
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.930
when we made that show.

77
00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.770
Your show is a testament to literally

78
00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.833
