82
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.400
Is it true that you babysat monkeys in middle school?

83
00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.340
Yes, I had, there were monkeys...

84
00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.690
There were monkeys that lived down the street.

85
00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.204
What, how?

86
00:03:52.204 --> 00:03:55.750
What was it like babysitting a monkey?

87
00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:56.583
Yeah.

88
00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:58.030
Well, it's weird that I did that, but I would...

89
00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.450
I don't know why I was...

90
00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.240
I don't remember how I found out

91
00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.510
and I don't remember how it was allowed to,

92
00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.230
but there were these monkeys, they were Capuchin monkeys,

93
00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.660
but they were babies.

94
00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.250
And these people down the street were like,

95
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.740
I don't know what to do with our monkey.

96
00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:13.138
I don't, we need somebody to babysit the monkeys.

97
00:04:13.138 --> 00:04:15.874
And I then would go and you know, like,

98
00:04:15.874 --> 00:04:18.494
