99
00:04:18.494 --> 00:04:20.150
That's like the big deal.

100
00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.790
Were you like, Virgil, don't do that.

101
00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.738
I was like, look at me.

102
00:04:24.738 --> 00:04:25.655
Don't do...

103
00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.030
So yeah, I'd make sure I...

104
00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:35.090
They would also like open the medicine cabinet, get Advil.

105
00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.390
If you weren't watching, they'd like, get Advil,

106
00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:40.293
lick the sugar off of it and then throw the pill

107
00:04:40.293 --> 00:04:43.220
without the sugar all around the kitchen.

108
00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.520
So that's, you had to make sure they kept the diapers on

109
00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.533
and that they didn't go into the medicine cabinet.

110
00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:52.443
Okay.

111
00:04:52.443 --> 00:04:53.276
That's so weird.

112
00:04:53.276 --> 00:04:55.095
I don't even know how we got here.

113
00:04:55.095 --> 00:04:58.570
I just had to ask and I'm so glad that I did

114
00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.902
