123
00:05:23.434 --> 00:05:26.470
If I didn't have hammers a lot.

124
00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.570
I mean, who has a hammer?

125
00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.410
I think if you don't have a hammer, you can take,

126
00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.032
