127
00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:35.460
I love that tip.

128
00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.170
Taylor Schilling, I have been such a fan of yours.

129
00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.244
I'm so excited to talk with you about such a meaningful,

130
00:05:41.244 --> 00:05:44.730
